 side are automatically pushed to MiniMongo on the client side.\"}, {\"id\": \"A1caf6346f38087\", \"component_name\": \"HTML5 Server\", \"target_sentence_id\": 8, \"target_sentence\": \"The HTML5 server sits behind nginx.\"}, {\"id\": \"A247c4fe105658b\", \"component_name\": \"Apps\", \"target_sentence_id\": 60, \"target_sentence\": \"Communication between apps and FreeSWITCH Event Socket Layer (fsels) uses messages through redis pubsub.\"}, {\"id\": \"A2b7fbd6623902c\", \"component_name\": \"HTML5 Client\", \"target_sentence_id\": 76, \"target_sentence\": \"Uploaded presentations go through a conversion process in order to be displayed inside the client.\"}]}"
